Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:14:43 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] unit B-1-telemetry: edits

Replace the 1DS appenders with implementations that send nothing, and keep the AI edit telemetry service id with an implementation that records nothing. Part of Shuko removal unit B-1-telemetry.
---
